zing, or services<br\/>- Cannot be combined with other promotions or discounts<br\/>- Each discount code is unique to the verified individual<br\/>- Codes may be used to purchase gifts, but cannot be shared<br\/>- One use per customer<br\/>- Eligibility is currently limited to U.S. residents<\/p><p>MiaDonna reserves the right to deactivate codes or cancel orders if misuse is detected.<\/p>","button_label":"","link":"","button_style":"button--primary","open_new_new_tab_button_1_ink":false,"button_label2":"","link2":"","button_style2":"button--primary","open_new_new_tab_button__2_link":false,"background":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","text_color":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","alignment":"center","vertical_position":"center"}},"image_z4Nq9m":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Community.png","image_link":"","iframe_video":""}}},"block_order":["text_hjkmiR","image_z4Nq9m"],"name":"Index image with text 2","settings":{"width":"wide","text_style":false,"sectionid":"section7","show_gutter":true,"padding_top":20,"padding_bottom":70,"animation":"none","arialabelledby":"","id_sec":"","css_class":"image-text-nw","custom_css":""}},"index_rich_text_FxFbyf":{"type":"index__rich-text","disabled":true,"name":"Rich text","settings":{"title":"HOW TO RECEIVE YOUR DISCOUNT","heading_font":"cormorant_n6","heading_color":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","heading_alignment":"center","heading_size":30,"text":"<p>Verification is quick, secure, and handled through <strong>ID.me<\/strong> at checkout.<\/p><p>1. Add your items to your cart<br\/>2. Select <strong>“Verify with ID.me”<br\/><\/strong>3. Complete the verification process to unlock your discount<\/p><p>If you need assistance with verification, ID.me Member Support is available at <strong>Help@ID.me<\/strong>.<\/p>","text_font":"open_sans_n4","text_color":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","text_alignment":"left","text_size":14,"columns":1,"button_label":"","button_link":"","button_alignment":"center","button_background":"#ffffff","button_text":"#ffffff","button_style":